Recording notes:
Clean Channel: inspired by early ‘60s single channel amplifiers. Volume, gain, high, middle and bass and a bright switch.
Vintage Channel: is a completely reworked channel (now something between original Duality100 Vintage channel and Leviathan CH1), act to start from a moderate to a very tight and percussive gain content. Sounds palette are easily manageable from a semi-clean tone to a very powerful crunch with just your right hand. Volume, treble, middle, bass, gain, bright switch, and lead boost;
Modern Channel: is derived from Leviathan CH2, and it’s tight, three-dimensional, rich and full of harmonic content. Volume, treble, middle, bass, gain, bright switch, and lead boost;
